  ⚠️ eta SUPPRESSED: reference 43,523 is for a 11x8 CAP loop; this run meshes 11x8 barrel. beta and Q_L are still valid — they come from the dip, not from Q_REF.
  ⚠️ BRANCH-FREE Q0 SUPPRESSED — no cavity.Q_ext.cold recorded for mount=barrel, gap2=0 mm, loop=11x8.
